{"ticker":"COP","updated":"2026-10-23T22:48:13Z","profile":{"longName":"ConocoPhillips","shortName":"ConocoPhillips","sector":"Energy","industry":"Oil & Gas E&P","country":"United States","website":"https://www.conocophillips.com","fullTimeEmployees":9600,"marketCap":181161689088,"trailingPE":19.97351,"forwardPE":13.997166,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":2.810495,"pegRatio":1.13,"targetMeanPrice":151.26923,"targetHighPrice":189.0,"targetLowPrice":126.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":26,"recommendationKey":"buy","revenueGrowth":0.355,"earningsGrowth":1.07,"grossMargins":0.47574002,"operatingMargins":0.3151,"profitMargins":0.144,"totalRevenue":64459001856,"beta":0.244,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":152.77,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":85.57,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NYQ","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":2.31},"summary":"ConocoPhillips explores for, produces, transports, and markets crude oil, bitumen, natural gas, liquefied natural gas (LNG), and natural gas liquids. It operates in five segments: Alaska; Lower 48; Canada; Europe, Middle East and North Africa; and Asia Pacific. The company's portfolio includes unconventional plays in North America; conventional assets in North America, Europe, Asia, and Australia; global LNG developments; oil sands assets in Canada; and an inventory of global exploration prospects. It serves in the United States, Canada, China, Equatorial Guinea, Libya, Malaysia, Norway, Singapore, the United Kingdom, and internationally. ConocoPhillips was founded in 1917 and is headquartered in Houston, Texas.","summary_zh":"康菲石油公司勘探、生產、運輸和銷售原油、瀝青、天然氣、液化天然氣 (LNG) 和液體天然氣。它分為五個部分：阿拉斯加；下48；加拿大;歐洲、中東和北非；和亞太地區。該公司的投資組合包括北美的非傳統戲劇；北美、歐洲、亞洲和澳洲的常規資產；全球液化天然氣發展；加拿大的油砂資產；以及全球勘探前景清單。它在美國、加拿大、中國、赤道幾內亞、利比亞、馬來西亞、挪威、新加坡、英國和國際上提供服務。康菲石油公司成立於 1917 年，總部位於德州休士頓。","sector_zh":"活力","industry_zh":"石油和天然氣勘探與生產","candles":[{"t":"2025-08-25","o":96.79,"h":98.22,"l":96.2,"c":98.18,"v":6850800},{"t":"2025-08-26","o":97.59,"h":98.0,"l":96.38,"c":97.05,"v":7052100},{"t":"2025-08-27","o":97.1,"h":98.63,"